{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前據報道，AMD下一代RDNA 5顯卡迎來新的開發進展，AMD近日已經提交新一輪圖形和計算驅動更新，初步加入GFX13圖形架構支持，相關代碼計劃進入Linux 7.5內核，為下一代Radeon GPU的軟件適配提前鋪路。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588212.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:03:52.151806+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:47:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_hash":"bee0b55f73e1cd5304e13134626675e4a755909c7fd8905aebdb5499221e7bbd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}